 ScenarioF;booker;res;ms;ok;result
⍝ ── F — Starvation (two locks) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
⍝ SlowReport holds 'SEATS' across its whole slow render, so bookings queue behind it.
⍝ The harness gives the report a small head start, then times booking 50 seats against
⍝ it. Racy (render under the hold), the booking waits out the render; fixed (snapshot,
⍝ render outside), it takes about as long as the booking work alone.
⍝ NOTE: this only shows once Book holds 'SEATS' (the Task A/B fix). Do the single-lock
⍝ tasks first, or booking never contends and this reads PASS for the wrong reason.
 NewSeats 1000
 booker←{_←⎕DL 0.02 ⋄ t0←3⊃⎕AI ⋄ _←Book¨⍳⍵ ⋄ (3⊃⎕AI)-t0}
 res←⎕TSYNC (SlowReport&0)(booker&50)
 ms←2⊃res
 ok←ms<200
 result←'FAIL' 'PASS'⊃⍨⎕IO+ok
 ⎕←'F starvation  : booking wall-clock = ',(⍕ms),' ms'
 ⎕←'Scenario F: ',result
